# An organisation's program: a machine account, by its PROGRAM id (stable
# across rotations). A SUBJECT: what it holds is given on one resource of
# its organisation, never in the organisation. Written by Polaris only
# (docs/autorizare/07 "Programs"); applications read it through the SDK.
type vega_program
